{"id":"ru-e4bdb628f433.en","jokeId":"ru-e4bdb628f433","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; the neighbour's gate is the village fence. The man walks up and knocks on the narration, the yard dog gets up from the house and comes to the gate, the man faints and gets up on the narrator's words.","title":"The Polite Dog","location":"derevnya","cast":["pyos","muzhik"],"roles":{"pyos":"dog","muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A man comes up to his neighbour's gate","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"and knocks.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"He knocks and knocks, but nobody answers.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"He knocks harder.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The dog quietly comes up to the gate and says:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"pyos","text":"Hey man, don't knock, there's nobody home.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Right then the man faints on the spot.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Afterwards he comes to, looks at the dog and says:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"What's wrong with you, dog, can't you bark?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The dog answers:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"pyos","text":"I can, but I didn't want to scare you.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","cast":["pyos","muzhik"],"roles":{"pyos":"dog","muzhik":"everyman"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"pyos","to":"house"},{"type":"act","who":"pyos","act":"lie"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"knock"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"knock"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"knock"},{"type":"shake","sec":1,"strength":"light"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"pyos","act":"stand"},{"type":"move","who":"pyos","to":"fence"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"faint"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"stand"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-e4bdb628f433.de","jokeId":"ru-e4bdb628f433","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; der Hund is masculine, so the male dog puppet fits. The neighbour's gate is the village fence; knocking, fainting and getting up are acted on the narration.","title":"Der höfliche Hund","location":"derevnya","cast":["pyos","muzhik"],"roles":{"pyos":"dog","muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Mann kommt an das Tor seines Nachbarn","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"und klopft.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er klopft und klopft, aber niemand antwortet.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er klopft fester.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Leise kommt ein Hund ans Tor und sagt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"pyos","text":"Mann, klopf nicht, es ist keiner zu Hause.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Da fällt der Mann sofort in Ohnmacht.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Danach kommt er wieder zu sich, schaut den Hund an und sagt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Was ist los mit dir, Hund, kannst du nicht bellen?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Hund antwortet:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"pyos","text":"Kann ich, aber ich wollte dich nicht erschrecken.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","cast":["pyos","muzhik"],"roles":{"pyos":"dog","muzhik":"everyman"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"pyos","to":"house"},{"type":"act","who":"pyos","act":"lie"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"knock"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"knock"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"knock"},{"type":"shake","sec":1,"strength":"light"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"pyos","act":"stand"},{"type":"move","who":"pyos","to":"fence"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"faint"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"stand"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-e39938a189b5.ru","jokeId":"ru-e39938a189b5","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Source words kept, including the dedication; the commander's report split into three lines. A second firefighter (sluzhivy in a helmet) shows the crew; they arrive on the narration, the commander flexes as a hero, walks up to the head doctor, the doctor faints and gets up on the narrator's words.","title":"Пожарные","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"firefighter","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"firefighter","doktor":"doctor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Доблестной Пожарной Охране посвящается...","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Приехали пожарные на вызов тушить больницу.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Ну, все сделали как и подобает настоящим героям:","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Пожар потушили, в грязь лицом не упали.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"После окончания тушения командир расчета докладывает главному врачу:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Задача выполнена, возгорание ликвидировано.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Правда... есть пострадавшие. Девять человек.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Семерых мы откачали, а двоих, к сожалению, спасти не удалось.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"После этих слов главврач падает в обморок.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Очнувшись, заикаясь и едва выговаривая слова, говорит:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Как семерых??? Ребята, вы же морг тушили...","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bolnitsa","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"firefighter","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"firefighter","doktor":"doctor"},"looks":{"sluzhivy":{"add":["helmet"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-left","to":"couch"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","act":"flex"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy","item":"bucket","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"faint"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"stand"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-e39938a189b5.en","jokeId":"ru-e39938a189b5","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line, dedication kept; 'в грязь лицом не упали' as 'didn't fall flat on their faces'. Crew shown by a second firefighter in a helmet; arrival, heroics, the faint and getting up are acted on the narration.","title":"The Firefighters","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"firefighter","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"firefighter","doktor":"doctor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Dedicated to our valiant Fire Brigade...","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The firefighters were called out to put out a fire at the hospital.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Well, they did everything the way real heroes should:","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"They put out the fire and didn't fall flat on their faces.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"When the job is done, the crew commander reports to the head doctor:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Mission accomplished, the fire has been put out.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Although... there are casualties. Nine people.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"We revived seven, but unfortunately we couldn't save the other two.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"At these words the head doctor faints.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"When he comes to, stammering and barely able to get the words out, he says:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"What do you mean, seven??? Guys, that was the morgue you were putting out...","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bolnitsa","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"firefighter","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"firefighter","doktor":"doctor"},"looks":{"sluzhivy":{"add":["helmet"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-left","to":"couch"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","act":"flex"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy","item":"bucket","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"faint"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"stand"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-e39938a189b5.de","jokeId":"ru-e39938a189b5","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line, dedication kept; 'в грязь лицом не упали' as 'blamierten sich nicht', Leichenhalle for the morgue. Crew shown by a second firefighter in a helmet; arrival, heroics, the faint and getting up are acted on the narration.","title":"Die Feuerwehr","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"firefighter","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"firefighter","doktor":"doctor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Der tapferen Feuerwehr gewidmet...","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Die Feuerwehr wird zu einem Brand im Krankenhaus gerufen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Nun, sie machten alles, wie es sich für echte Helden gehört:","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Sie löschten das Feuer und blamierten sich nicht.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Nach dem Löschen meldet der Einsatzleiter dem Chefarzt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Auftrag erfüllt, der Brand ist gelöscht.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Allerdings... gibt es Verletzte. Neun Personen.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Sieben haben wir wiederbelebt, aber zwei konnten wir leider nicht retten.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Bei diesen Worten fällt der Chefarzt in Ohnmacht.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Als er wieder zu sich kommt, sagt er stotternd und kaum fähig, die Worte herauszubringen:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"doktor","text":"Wie, sieben??? Leute, ihr habt doch die Leichenhalle gelöscht...","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bolnitsa","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"firefighter","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"firefighter","doktor":"doctor"},"looks":{"sluzhivy":{"add":["helmet"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-left","to":"couch"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","act":"flex"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy","item":"bucket","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"faint"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"act","who":"doktor","act":"stand"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"}]}]}
{"id":"en-r-70b5ut.en","jokeId":"en-r-70b5ut","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Q&A told by the narrator over two blind men (dark glasses, white canes) punching each other; a bystander yells the punchline and both blind men freeze with hands up.","title":"Two Blind Guys","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"disabled-person","muzhik-sosed":"disabled-person","muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"How do you break up two blind guys fighting?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Yell:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"My money's on the guy with the knife!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"disabled-person","muzhik-sosed":"disabled-person","muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik-ryzhy":{"add":["dark-glasses"]},"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["dark-glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-sosed","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"punch","to":"muzhik-sosed"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"punch","to":"muzhik-ryzhy"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"hands-up"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"hands-up"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]}]}
{"id":"en-r-70b5ut.ru","jokeId":"en-r-70b5ut","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated literally; 'my money's on' as 'ставлю на'. Two blind men in dark glasses with white canes punch each other, a bystander yells and both freeze with hands up.","title":"Двое слепых","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"disabled-person","muzhik-sosed":"disabled-person","muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Как разнять двух дерущихся слепых?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Крикнуть:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ставлю на того, что с ножом!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"disabled-person","muzhik-sosed":"disabled-person","muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik-ryzhy":{"add":["dark-glasses"]},"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["dark-glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-sosed","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"punch","to":"muzhik-sosed"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"punch","to":"muzhik-ryzhy"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"hands-up"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"hands-up"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]}]}
{"id":"en-r-70b5ut.de","jokeId":"en-r-70b5ut","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated literally; 'my money's on' as 'ich setze auf'. Two blind men in dark glasses with white canes punch each other, a bystander yells and both freeze with hands up.","title":"Zwei Blinde","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"disabled-person","muzhik-sosed":"disabled-person","muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Wie trennt man zwei Blinde, die sich prügeln?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Man ruft:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich setze auf den mit dem Messer!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"disabled-person","muzhik-sosed":"disabled-person","muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik-ryzhy":{"add":["dark-glasses"]},"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["dark-glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-sosed","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"punch","to":"muzhik-sosed"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"punch","to":"muzhik-ryzhy"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"hands-up"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"hands-up"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]}]}
{"id":"en-r-9h7qsa.en","jokeId":"en-r-9h7qsa","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Source words kept ('etc.' spelled out for TTS, numbers as words); one scene per day with wipe transitions so every repetition is shown. Coins dropped on the floor are coin drop beats, picking them up is a kneel, the beer is a glass handed over; 'asshole' softened to 'jerk' in text.","title":"Twenty Quarters","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A guy walks into a bar and asks for a beer.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"That'll be five dollars.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Says the bartender, and the guy throws twenty quarters onto the floor.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Reluctantly, the bartender picks up the coins","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"and serves the beer.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The next day, the guy comes into the bar, asks for a beer,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"throws twenty quarters onto the floor, et cetera.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The next day, again.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"On the fourth day, he asks for a beer,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"and hands the bartender a ten-dollar bill.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The bartender takes advantage of his chance for revenge,","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"throws twenty quarters onto the floor and yells:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"Here's your change, jerk!","uncensored":"Here's your change, asshole!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The guy looks down at the coins and says:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"I'll have another beer, please.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"drop"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"kneel"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"stand"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"glass","action":"give","to":"muzhik"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"drop"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"facepalm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"drop"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"kneel"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":